       01  Filler.
      * SEC-001 (CWE-862): needed to resolve RTFRE120-I-Fin-Inst-No-D
      * (an external, caller-supplied code) into the same internal
      * Konsern-Id domain as R400CH01-Fininst-Id, via the identical
      * pattern already used by F115IMC0.src's N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID.
           Copy R5879010.
