      *################################################################*        
      * Check dependencies against databas fields.                     *        
      *                                                                *        
      * Here we perform all nesecarry control , befor return to the    *        
      * H-module.                                                      *        
      *                                                                *        
      * Add Perform statements to other sections that contain the      *        
      * actual controls.                                               *        
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*        
      *<META E000-CONTROL-BASE>                                                 
       E000-Control-Base                 Section.                               
      *                                                                         
      *</META>
      *
      * SEC-001 (CWE-862): RTFRE120-I-Fin-Inst-No-D was never validated
      * against the authenticated session's own institution, so a caller
      * could read another institution's contract charges/history by
      * supplying a different Fin-Inst-No. Resolve it to the same
      * internal Konsern-Id domain R400CH01-Fininst-Id is in (mirroring
      * F115IMC0.src N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID, lines 1246-1270) before
      * comparing - comparing the raw external code against the internal
      * ID directly, as an earlier draft of this patch did, would compare
      * two different identifier domains and likely never match at all.
      * REVIEWER: confirm R5879010-Ut-KO-Konsern-Id is genuinely the same
      * value R400CH01-Fininst-Id holds at runtime (both are populated by
      * infrastructure outside this repo) before applying; register
      * message code 'GL-IKKE-TILGANG&' in your shop's message table if
      * it does not already exist.
           Initialize                     R5879010-Konsern
           Set   R5879010-Versjon   To    True
           Set   R5879010-In-Select To    True
           Move  RTFRE120-I-Fin-Inst-No-D (1:4)
                                     To    R5879010-In-Konsernnr
           Call  'F5879010'         Using R5879010-Konsern
                                           R7919999-Error
           End-Call
           If  Not R7919999-Return-OK
               Perform Z900-Abend
           End-If
           If  R5879010-Ut-KO-Konsern-Id Not = R400CH01-Fininst-Id
               Move  'F'                 To    RTFRE120-I-Fin-Inst-No-O
               Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)
               Move  'Fin-Inst-No'       To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1)
               Move  'GL-IKKE-TILGANG&'  To    R400CH01-Message-Code
               Perform  Z700-Error-AE
           End-If
      *
           .
      *
      *<META E000-CONTROL-BASE-EX>
       E000-Control-Base-Ex.
           Exit.                                                                
      *</META>                                                                  
                                                                                
