      *<META Z900-ABEND>                                                        
       Z900-Abend                        Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Set   R7919999-Return-Abend   To    True                             
           If    R400CH01-Message-Code   =     'FM'                             
                 String   'FTFRK120'           Delimited By Size                
                          ': '                 Delimited By Size                
                       R7919999-Message        Delimited By Size                
                                         Into  R400CH01-Message-Text            
                 End-String                                                     
           Else                                                                 
                 Move  'FTFRK120'        To    R400CH01-Message-Text            
           End-If                                                               
      *                                                                         
